id=usbmanager_dcs
name=USB Manager (no LSPosed)
version=v1.2.0
versionCode=120
author=@Dev_DcS
description=Asks what to do every time you plug into a computer (USB mode + ADB per connection). USB guard: restarts the phone if an unknown device is connected while locked and it is not unlocked in time. Optional full USB data block, enforced in the kernel on the dev-dcs GKI builds. No Xposed needed.
